(1,'Home','The home page','@@protect(true)
##Tag(Home|Official)
##Image(TightWiki Logo.png | 25)
^^^^^Welcome to **TightWiki** v##appversion!
We like to think about TightWiki as a modern solution to running a wiki site. Whether you are looking to open it up to the world, provide it to a team for documentation and collaboration or use it for your own note taking - we think you’ll find that TightWiki is fast, easy to use and powerful.


##include(Development Notes)
