${metaColor = #ee2401}
${keywordColor = #318000}
${identifierColor = #c6680e}
==Overview
The SearchList standard function produces a simple bulleted list of pages built by searching the page body for the tokens passed to the function.


==Prototype
##Color(${keywordColor} | **#{ ##SearchList }#**)(##Color(${keywordColor} | string) [##Color(${identifierColor} | searchPhrase)] | ##Color(${keywordColor} | string) {##Color(${identifierColor} | styleName)} | ##Color(${keywordColor} | integer) {##Color(${identifierColor} | pageSize)} | ##Color(${keywordColor} | bool) {##Color(${identifierColor} | pageSelector)} | ##Color(${keywordColor} | bool) {##Color(${identifierColor} | allowFuzzyMatching)})


===Parameters
{{{Bullets
**Name:** ##Color(${identifierColor} | searchPhrase) ##Color(${metaColor} | [Required])
>**Type:** ##Color(${keywordColor} | string)
>**Description:** The search phrase to use for the search query.
**Name:** ##Color(${identifierColor} | styleName) ##Color(${metaColor} | {Optional})
>**Type:** ##Color(${keywordColor} | string)
>**Default:** ##Color(${identifierColor} | Full)
>**Values:** ##Color(${identifierColor} | list, full)
>**Description:** The style name for the result listing.
**Name:** ##Color(${identifierColor} | pageSize) ##Color(${metaColor} | {Optional})
>**Type:** ##Color(${keywordColor} | integer)
>**Default:** ##Color(${identifierColor} | 5)
>**Description:** The number of results per page when paging.
**Name:** ##Color(${identifierColor} | pageSelector) ##Color(${metaColor} | {Optional})
>**Type:** ##Color(${keywordColor} | bool)
>**Default:** ##Color(${identifierColor} | true)
>**Description:** Whether to show the page selector (first, previous, next, last).
**Name:** ##Color(${identifierColor} | allowFuzzyMatching) ##Color(${metaColor} | {Optional})
>**Type:** ##Color(${keywordColor} | bool)
>**Default:** ##Color(${identifierColor} | false)
>**Description:** Whether the search engine should use fuzzy (non-exact) matching.
}}}

==Examples
{{{Code(wiki)#{

##SearchList(Wiki help)

}#}}}

