(1968,'Image - Standard Function - Wiki Help','Display images in the wiki body.','@@protect(true)
##Image(Wiki Help/TightWiki Logo.png | 15)
##title ##Tag(Official-Help | Help | Wiki | Official | Standard Function)
{{{Card(Default | Table of Contents) ##toc }}}

${metaColor = #ee2401}
${keywordColor = #318000}
${identifierColor = #c6680e}
==Overview
When editing a page you can attach images. The images are stored with and managed on the page for which they are attached. Displaying these images is straightforward with some flexibility for the way they are displayed.

While the files and images are attached to a single page, they can also be referenced on one page from another.


==Prototype
##Color(${keywordColor} | **#{ ##Image }#**)(##Color(${keywordColor} | string) [##Color(${identifierColor} | name)] | ##Color(${keywordColor} | integer) {##Color(${identifierColor} | scale)} | ##Color(${keywordColor} | string) {##Color(${identifierColor} | altText)})


===Parameters
{{{Bullets
**Name:** ##Color(${identifierColor} | name) ##Color(${metaColor} | [Required])
>**Type:** ##Color(${keywordColor} | string)
>**Description:** The name of the page attached image.
**Name:** ##Color(${identifierColor} | scale) ##Color(${metaColor} | {Optional})
>**Type:** ##Color(${keywordColor} | integer)
>**Default:** ##Color(${identifierColor} | 100)
>**Description:** The optional scale of image. The engine will automatically resize the image for display.
**Name:** ##Color(${identifierColor} | altText) ##Color(${metaColor} | {Optional})
>**Type:** ##Color(${keywordColor} | string)
>**Description:** The optional "alt tag" for the image. This can be useful for search engines, context and accessibility.
}}}

==Examples
===Attached Images
**Displaying an image that is attached to the page:**
{{{Code(wiki)#{
##Image(TightWiki Logo.png)
}#}}}

**Displaying an image that is attached to the page scaled to 25%:**
{{{Code(wiki)#{
##Image(TightWiki Logo.png | 25)
}#}}}

**Displaying an image that is attached to the page scaled to 25% with an alternate caption**
{{{Code(wiki)#{
##Image(TightWiki Logo.png | 25 | The image caption)
}#}}}

===Images from other pages
**Displaying an image that is attached to another page:**
{{{Code(wiki)#{
##Image(Some other Page/TightWiki Logo.png)
}#}}}

==Direct Reference
Also keep in mind that you can directly reference a page attached image:

{{{Card#{
https://tightwiki.com/File/Image/tightwiki_media/tightwiki_logo_png
}#}}}

==See Also
[[Function Calling Convention - Wiki Help]]
[[Scope Function - Wiki Help]]
[[Instruction Function - Wiki Help]]
[[Standard Function - Wiki Help]]


==Related
##related
